{
  "name": "Prevent Duplicate Webhook Processing with an Idempotency Guard",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "e24f6a80-9f37-4c21-8199-228121c95f3e",
      "name": "Overview Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1600,
        -520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 600,
        "height": 280,
        "content": "## Webhook Idempotency Guard\n\nPrevent duplicate webhook processing with a reusable idempotency ledger stored in n8n Data Tables.\n\n**Endpoint**\n`POST /webhook/idempotency-guard`\n\nThe response contains `allow_processing`. Continue downstream only when it is `true`."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "921769a8-5f51-4bf0-a9f8-403f6989339c",
      "name": "Input Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -960,
        -520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 6,
        "width": 400,
        "height": 340,
        "content": "## Request\n\n```json\n{\n  \"idempotency_key\": \"provider-event-123\",\n  \"scope\": \"payments\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"amount\": 4900\n  }\n}\n```\n\n`scope` is optional and defaults to `default`."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "05b172be-ea06-43f4-8571-5ec1852733c0",
      "name": "Configuration Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -520,
        -520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 400,
        "height": 280,
        "content": "## Configuration\n\nEdit **Configure Guard**:\n\n- `record_ttl_hours`\n- `default_scope`\n- `max_key_length`\n\nA key becomes processable again after its ledger record expires."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "d7689b36-0de4-44d3-83f5-251aef318946",
      "name": "Data Table Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -80,
        -520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "width": 440,
        "height": 360,
        "content": "## Required Data Table\n\nCreate **webhook_idempotency** with:\n\n- ledger_key — String\n- scope — String\n- idempotency_key — String\n- status — String\n- first_seen_at — DateTime\n- last_seen_at — DateTime\n- expires_at — DateTime\n- duplicate_count — Number\n\nSelect it in all four Data Table nodes."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "566a08f2-e5e8-4e03-ab0f-46a0cf31d659",
      "name": "Decision Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        400,
        -520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 2,
        "width": 400,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Decisions\n\n- Missing key → `process_event`\n- Existing unexpired key → `duplicate_ignored`\n- Existing expired key → `process_event`\n\nUse both `scope` and `idempotency_key` to avoid collisions between event sources."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "2f2db78b-7a11-4f46-8cb1-dd6d2f6f0071",
      "name": "Concurrency Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        840,
        -520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 440,
        "height": 260,
        "content": "## Production note\n\nData Tables provide a simple zero-credential ledger. Very high-concurrency payment systems should use a transactional database with a unique constraint on `ledger_key`."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "22bbf615-fe66-4d61-a765-f0543dd29a29",
      "name": "Receive Webhook Event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "position": [
        -1504,
        280
      ],
      "webhookId": "idempotency-guard-template-v1",
      "parameters": {
        "path": "idempotency-guard",
        "options": {},
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "responseMode": "lastNode"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.1
    },
    {
      "id": "8ad23c58-a2c9-410f-aab7-443303618812",
      "name": "Normalize Event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        -1264,
        280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const body = $json.body ?? $json;\n\nif (\n  body.idempotency_key === undefined ||\n  body.idempotency_key === null ||\n  String(body.idempotency_key).trim() === ''\n) {\n  throw new Error('idempotency_key is required');\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    idempotency_key: String(body.idempotency_key).trim(),\n    scope: body.scope === undefined || body.scope === null\n      ? ''\n      : String(body.scope).trim(),\n    payload: body.payload ?? null,\n    received_at: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "1df3ad1d-a4d7-4267-95f9-e20d5308879b",
      "name": "Configure Guard",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        -1024,
        280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const config = {\n  record_ttl_hours: 24,\n  default_scope: 'default',\n  max_key_length: 255\n};\n\nconst input = $json;\nconst scope = input.scope || config.default_scope;\n\nif (!Number.isFinite(config.record_ttl_hours) || config.record_ttl_hours <= 0) {\n  throw new Error('record_ttl_hours must be greater than zero');\n}\n\nif (input.idempotency_key.length > config.max_key_length) {\n  throw new Error(\n    'idempotency_key exceeds max_key_length (' +\n    config.max_key_length +\n    ')'\n  );\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...input,\n    scope,\n    ledger_key: scope + ':' + input.idempotency_key,\n    config\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "256135dd-8739-41ca-957c-fce699150c29",
      "name": "Find Existing Key",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.dataTable",
      "position": [
        -784,
        280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "limit": 1,
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "ledger_key",
              "keyValue": "={{ $('Configure Guard').item.json.ledger_key }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "matchType": "allConditions",
        "operation": "get",
        "dataTableId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "webhook_idempotency"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "id": "2eb31ea7-c55d-4dd4-93b1-8b9d3ae15d20",
      "name": "Evaluate Idempotency",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        -544,
        280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const input = $('Configure Guard').first().json;\nconst existing = $json;\nconst now = new Date(input.received_at);\nconst expiresAt = existing.expires_at\n  ? new Date(existing.expires_at)\n  : null;\nconst validExpiry =\n  expiresAt && !Number.isNaN(expiresAt.getTime());\nconst nextExpiry = new Date(\n  now.getTime() +\n  Number(input.config.record_ttl_hours) * 60 * 60 * 1000\n).toISOString();\n\nif (!existing.ledger_key) {\n  return [{\n    json: {\n      route: 'create',\n      action: 'process_event',\n      allow_processing: true,\n      ledger_key: input.ledger_key,\n      scope: input.scope,\n      idempotency_key: input.idempotency_key,\n      status: 'accepted',\n      first_seen_at: now.toISOString(),\n      last_seen_at: now.toISOString(),\n      expires_at: nextExpiry,\n      duplicate_count: 0,\n      payload: input.payload\n    }\n  }];\n}\n\nif (validExpiry && expiresAt > now) {\n  return [{\n    json: {\n      route: 'duplicate',\n      action: 'duplicate_ignored',\n      allow_processing: false,\n      ledger_key: existing.ledger_key,\n      scope: existing.scope,\n      idempotency_key: existing.idempotency_key,\n      status: existing.status || 'accepted',\n      first_seen_at: existing.first_seen_at,\n      last_seen_at: now.toISOString(),\n      expires_at: existing.expires_at,\n      duplicate_count: Number(existing.duplicate_count || 0) + 1,\n      payload: input.payload\n    }\n  }];\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    route: 'refresh',\n    action: 'process_event',\n    allow_processing: true,\n    ledger_key: input.ledger_key,\n    scope: input.scope,\n    idempotency_key: input.idempotency_key,\n    status: 'accepted',\n    first_seen_at: now.toISOString(),\n    last_seen_at: now.toISOString(),\n    expires_at: nextExpiry,\n    duplicate_count: 0,\n    payload: input.payload\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
